<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Iberdrola, Fenosa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Iberdrola, Fenosa cut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity utilities Iberdrola and Union Fenosa were downgraded by analysts at Goldman Sachs, the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Iberdrola was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from Goldman's &quot;recommended&quot; list while Fenosa was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;trading buy.&quot;</p>
<p>Analysts at Goldman were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
